### Dashboard
@dashboard = http://127.0.0.1:8100
@lb = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@master = http://127.0.0.1:9000
@worker1 = http://127.0.0.1:8001
@worker2 = http://127.0.0.1:8002
@worker3 = http://127.0.0.1:8003
@worker4 = http://127.0.0.1:8004

### ─── Dashboard ───────────────────────────────────────────

### Dashboard UI (HTML page)
GET {{dashboard}}/

### Dashboard API (aggregated system data)
GET {{dashboard}}/api/dashboard

### ─── Load Balancer ───────────────────────────────────────

### LB Health
GET {{lb}}/health

### LB Stats (latency percentiles, throughput, error rate)
GET {{lb}}/stats

### LB Worker List
GET {{lb}}/workers

### Current Routing Strategy
GET {{lb}}/strategy

### Query via LB (single request)
POST {{lb}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "tell me about dogs", "top_k": 3}

### Query via LB — cat
POST {{lb}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "tell me about cats", "top_k": 3}

### Query via LB — birds
POST {{lb}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "tell me about birds", "top_k": 3}

### Change Strategy to Round Robin
POST {{lb}}/strategy
Content-Type: application/json

{"strategy": "round_robin"}

### Change Strategy to Least Connections
POST {{lb}}/strategy
Content-Type: application/json

{"strategy": "least_connections"}

### Change Strategy to Hybrid
POST {{lb}}/strategy
Content-Type: application/json

{"strategy": "hybrid"}

### Change Strategy to GPU-Aware
POST {{lb}}/strategy
Content-Type: application/json

{"strategy": "gpu_aware"}

### Change Strategy to Load-Aware
POST {{lb}}/strategy
Content-Type: application/json

{"strategy": "load_aware"}

### Mark Worker Unhealthy (simulate failure)
POST {{lb}}/worker/unhealthy
Content-Type: application/json

{"worker_id": "worker-1"}

### Mark Worker Healthy (recover)
POST {{lb}}/worker/healthy
Content-Type: application/json

{"worker_id": "worker-1"}

### Pending Requests Count
GET {{lb}}/pending/count

### ─── Master Node ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Master Health
GET {{master}}/health

### Registered Workers
GET {{master}}/workers

### Metrics Summary
GET {{master}}/metrics

### Schedule Endpoint (ask master for best worker)
POST {{master}}/schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{"strategy": "hybrid"}

### ─── Individual Workers ─────────────────────────────────

### Worker 1 — Health
GET {{worker1}}/health

### Worker 1 — GPU Stats
GET {{worker1}}/gpu-stats

### Worker 1 — Direct Query
POST {{worker1}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "hamster facts", "top_k": 3}

### Worker 2 — Health
GET {{worker2}}/health

### Worker 3 — Health
GET {{worker3}}/health

### Worker 4 — Health
GET {{worker4}}/health

### ─── Quick Smoke Test (all at once) ──────────────────────

### Check all services are up
GET {{master}}/health

GET {{lb}}/health

GET {{worker1}}/health

GET {{worker2}}/health

GET {{worker3}}/health

GET {{worker4}}/health

GET {{dashboard}}/api/dashboard
